ooz — open-source Oodle-compatible compression/decompression
==============================================================

Origin: Copyright (C) 2016, Powzix (https://github.com/powzix/ooz)
License: GNU General Public License v3 (see the header of kraken.cpp)

These sources are the subset of ooz that the poe_bundle crate v0.1.5
(https://crates.io/crates/poe_bundle) vendored and built as `libooz`
(the OOZ_SOURCES list in its ooz/CMakeLists.txt), copied here verbatim
so the library can be compiled directly by build.rs with the `cc` crate
instead of through poe_bundle's cmake build.

ooz_shim.cpp is new (this project): thin extern "C" wrappers around
CompressBlock and GetCompressedBufferSizeNeeded so Rust FFI binds
unmangled symbol names.

Note: this code was already statically linked into release binaries of
this project via the poe_bundle crate; vendoring it here only makes the
provenance visible in-repo.
